            "1 Guang o, neihlaamei thiu,",
            "Kaipouc zanc zianmei thiu,",
            "Nang ngamv guay tiipatna",
            "Kazanc hym dinc ’dauh o;",
            "Dinc o, kauhmei, dihmei guay khou, (2)",
            "Kazauzian pow nang phunghmei 2^<.",
            "",
            "2 Gaanchuangc duanhmei pyrun,",
            "Guangh pwan luaklou ducna,",
            "Zianmei sw khou samc key,",
            "Kaplou, zei key, theiclou,",
            "’Niw phaan ’khaengvloumei saa ngam mak, (2)",
            "Theihmei lev t’ruaih khou !}2 gu khang.",
            "",
            "3 T’rou zingh khou !}2 thau the,",
            "Theihmei kaidai khou !}2",
            "Zauczihmei guay ruc khou",
            "Hymdaicna rih ngam the;",
            "Rih ngammeipu kauh ku kan the, (2)",
            "Kaipouc Jisu guanghtu bam the.",
            "",
            "4 Kamei key nuangc puni,",
            "Kating neic thay mak ge,",
            "’Niu ta kai phungc ku ni,",
            "Gaanc taan lakmei dic khou;",
            "Kazawpaanv gaymei ’niu how ni, (2)",
            "Kapamv khou taek makna bam ni."
